lign="top" char="." charoff="50">3</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50">5</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50">2</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50">35</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">(4)</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">Microcalcification</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50">39</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50">34</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50">46</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50">19</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50">13</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50">20</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50">171</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">(0)</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">Total number</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50">113</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50">68</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50">62</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50">42</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50">49</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50">38</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50">372</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">(102)</td></tr></tbody></table><table-wrap-foot><fn id="t1-fn1"><label/><p>DCIS&#x0003d;ductal carcinoma <italic>in situ</italic>.</p></fn><fn id="t1-fn2"><label>a</label><p>This included six cases of suspicious CNB results (retained only for descriptive analysis).</p></fn><fn id="t1-fn3"><label>b</label><p>&#x02018;Atypical hyperplasias' included atypical ductal hyperplasia and lobular intraepithelial neoplasia (lesions associated with increased future risk of breast cancer).</p></fn><fn id="t1-fn4"><label>c</label><p>Number palpable&#x0003d;number of lesions from total (and for each type of mammographic lesion) considered to be evident on clinical examination.</p></fn></table-wrap-foot></table-wrap><table-wrap id="tbl2" position="float"><label>Table 2</label><caption><p content-type="table-title">Lesions of uncertain malignant potential (B3) on CNB: excision histology outcomes for different B3 lesions and associated PPV for breast malignancy</p></caption><table frame="hsides" rules="groups" border="1" width="85%"><colgroup><col align="left"/><col align="center"/><col align="center"/><col align="center"/><col align="center"/><col align="center"/><col align="center"/><col align="center"/><col align="left"/><col align="center"/><col align="left"/></colgroup><thead valign="bottom"><tr><th rowspan="2" align="left" valign="top" charoff="50"><bold>Subcategory of B3 core needle histology (number of cases with excision outcomes)</bold></th><th colspan="4" align="center" valign="top" charoff="50"><bold>Benign on excision histology</bold></th><th rowspan="2" align="center" valign="top" charoff="50"><bold>Invasive cancer</bold></th><th rowspan="2" align="center" valign="top" charoff="50"><bold>DCIS</bold></th><th rowspan="2" colspan="2" align="center" valign="top" charoff="50"><bold>PPV &#x00025; (excision or review)<sup>b</sup></bold></th><th rowspan="2" colspan="2" align="center" valign="top" charoff="50"><bold>PPV &#x00025; (excision histology)<sup>c</sup></bold></th></tr><tr><th colspan="2" align="center" valign="top" charoff="50"><bold>Number (&#x00025; of all excised lesions)</bold></th><th colspan="2" align="center" valign="top" charoff="50"><bold>Number with concordant histology (number upstaged to a high risk lesion<sup>a</sup>)</bold></th></tr></thead><tbody valign="top"><tr><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">ADH<sup>d</sup> (141)</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">78</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">(55.3)</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">42</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">(NA)</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">21</td><td align="